OL,10,G0350FWitness History
OL,11,     GIn 1982, Paraguay and Brazil
OL,12,     Gclosed the gates of the Itaipu
OL,13,     GDam to fill its reservoir. But as
OL,14,     Gthe water rose, thousands of
OL,15,     Ganimals had to be rescued as
OL,16,     Gtheir habitat was flooded.
